&lt;h2 id=&quot;item-description__key-features&quot;&gt;Key Features&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SmartStore is a feature-rich SMM panel script designed to make your reselling business fast, flexible, and fully automated — without writing a single line of code. Here’s what you get:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;item-description__top-10-features-of-smartstore&quot;&gt;Top 10 Features of SmartStore&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Auto Order Forwarding:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Instantly sends orders to your SMM API providers — fully automated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-API Integration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Connect multiple providers with smart parameter compatibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unlimited Services:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Create endless categories, services, and social platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsive Design:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Optimized for all devices — desktop, tablet, and mobile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drag &amp; Drop Page Builder:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Build custom landing pages without coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Powerful Admin Dashboard:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Manage everything with real-time stats and control tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SEO &amp; Blog System:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Boost traffic with built-in SEO tools and a content blog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrated Payments:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Accept PayPal and Stripe payments out of the box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Legal &amp; GDPR Ready:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Comes with pre-built legal pages and cookie policy support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Built on CodeIgniter 4.x:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Modern, fast, and secure PHP framework foundation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;item-description__full-feature-list&quot;&gt;Full Feature List&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__auto-order-forwarding-via-api&quot;&gt;Auto Order Forwarding via API&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Automatically send customer orders to your SMM API providers with real-time syncing. No manual action needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__multi-api-provider-support&quot;&gt;Multi-API Provider Support&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Connect and manage multiple SMM API sources at once with smart, compatible parameter structures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__unlimited-services-categories-and-platforms&quot;&gt;Unlimited Services, Categories, and Platforms&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create and manage unlimited social media services across any platform — grow without restrictions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__drag-and-drop-page-builder&quot;&gt;Drag-and-Drop Page Builder&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design custom landing pages or content sections with an intuitive drag-and-drop interface — no coding required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__powerful-admin-dashboard&quot;&gt;Powerful Admin Dashboard&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track orders, users, income, and system stats from a clean and modern dashboard interface.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__built-in-theme-customizer&quot;&gt;Built-in Theme Customizer&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Switch between light/dark mode, adjust menus, and personalize the site appearance instantly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__responsive-and-mobile-optimized-design&quot;&gt;Responsive and Mobile-Optimized Design&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SmartStore looks great and functions perfectly on desktops, tablets, and mobile devices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__one-click-installation&quot;&gt;One-Click Installation&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Install the full system in just a few minutes with a guided setup — no technical knowledge needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__support-ticket-system-amp-faq-builder&quot;&gt;Support Ticket System &amp; FAQ Builder&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide customer support directly from your panel and create helpful FAQs with ease.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__maintenance-mode&quot;&gt;Maintenance Mode&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Temporarily pause public access while you perform maintenance or updates — without affecting admin access.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__built-in-payment-gateway-integration&quot;&gt;Built-in Payment Gateway Integration&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accept payments via PayPal, Stripe, and more with built-in gateway support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__email-notifications&quot;&gt;Email Notifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Send automated emails to users for order updates, payments, alerts, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__customizable-email-templates&quot;&gt;Customizable Email Templates&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Edit and personalize email content using simple variables — works with both PHP mail and SMTP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__seo-optimization&quot;&gt;SEO Optimization&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage meta tags, page titles, and descriptions to boost your search engine visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__built-in-blog-system&quot;&gt;Built-in Blog System&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Publish SEO-friendly blog posts to attract traffic and inform customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__news-amp-announcements-via-beamer-js&quot;&gt;News &amp; Announcements via Beamer JS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engage users with real-time updates using the integrated Beamer notification system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__custom-javascript-support&quot;&gt;Custom JavaScript Support&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add analytics, chat widgets, or any custom JS code directly into your site’s frontend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__multilingual-support&quot;&gt;Multilingual Support&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translate your entire panel to multiple languages and reach a broader audience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__simple-analytics-and-system-info&quot;&gt;Simple Analytics and System Info&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitor traffic, orders, and basic server info from the admin dashboard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__guest-checkout-no-registration&quot;&gt;Guest Checkout (No Registration)&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Allow clients to place orders without requiring them to register an account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__legal-pages-included&quot;&gt;Legal Pages Included&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pre-built Terms of Service, Privacy Policy, and Cookies Policy pages — ready to edit and publish.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__footer-amp-site-content-control&quot;&gt;Footer &amp; Site Content Control&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage contact info, logo, social links, and more directly from the admin panel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__editable-pages&quot;&gt;Editable Pages&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Edit static pages like About, Contact, etc., right from the admin dashboard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__coupon-system&quot;&gt;Coupon System&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create discount codes to drive sales and attract new customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__blacklist-system&quot;&gt;Blacklist System&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Block unwanted users or IP addresses from accessing your platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;item-description__powered-by-codeigniter-4-x&quot;&gt;Powered by CodeIgniter 4.x&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built on a modern PHP framework — secure, fast, and developer-friendly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;item-description__server-requirements&quot;&gt;Server Requirements:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PHP 8.1 or higher is required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MySQL 5.7+ or MariaDB 10.2+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apache with mod_rewrite enabled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Required PHP Extensions:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MySQLi&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PDO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;cURL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OpenSSL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBString&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zip&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;intl&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fileinfo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;allow_url_fopen&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;must be enabled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Now built using CodeIgniter 4.x Framework&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full documentation available:&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://smartpanelsmm.com/docs/smartstore.php&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Click here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;item-description__important-migration-note&quot;&gt;Important Migration Note:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SmartStore Version 2.0 has been fully rebuilt using CodeIgniter 4.x.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;This new version introduces a completely restructured and modernized codebase for improved performance, security, and maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All previous versions based on CodeIgniter 3.x&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;cannot be directly upgraded&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;to Version 2.0.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must perform a&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;fresh installation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;to use the latest version.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All core files, route handling, controllers, and folder structures have changed significantly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;back up your current data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;and test on a staging server before deploying in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you rely on custom modifications, consider whether full migration is appropriate at this time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We highly recommend reviewing the updated documentation before upgrading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;item-description__important-notes-before-you-buy&quot;&gt;Important Notes Before You Buy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hosting compatibility:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Make sure your hosting environment matches the&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;section before purchasing. We cannot debug issues caused by incompatible servers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Refund policy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;As this is a digital product,&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;no refunds&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;are possible after download, regardless of the reason — including accidental purchase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support availability:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;We aim to respond within 1–2 business days. Please note that high volumes of non-support inquiries (like feature requests or general questions) may slow down response time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expired support:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;If your support period has expired, please consider renewing it before submitting support tickets or questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do your part:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Before contacting us, please read the full product description, check the live demo, and search for answers to your question in the documentation or FAQ.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support scope:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;We only provide support for issues related to bugs or core features of the script. We do not offer support for general web hosting, server setup, PHP programming, or web scaling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No support for custom code:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;If you make changes to the source code or apply third-party modifications, we cannot guarantee compatibility or offer troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;We provide support in English only. Please make sure your messages are clear so we can assist you effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;If you plan to charge your users for access or services, you must purchase an&lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extended License&lt;/strong&gt;. The Regular License does not permit commercial use involving end-user payments.&lt;/p&gt;
